    "body": "Decision: Shared Party Magic Inventory stays enabled when selected, but the runtime does not merge inventories until the existing stocks fit one 32-slot pool with no spell above 100 copies. Until then, FF8 shows a clear in-game warning and leaves every private inventory unchanged. The implementation must never cap, discard, or duplicate magic.",
